# =====================================================================
# UpVital — .gitignore
# Monorepo: mobile/ (Expo/React Native iOS), backend/ (Express/TS), web/ (static).
# Rule of thumb: never commit secrets or generated build output.
# Patterns are un-anchored so they match in every workspace.
# =====================================================================

# ---------- Secrets & local env (NEVER commit) ----------
# backend/.env holds real server secrets; mobile/.env holds EXPO_PUBLIC_* (public,
# but ignored for hygiene). The committed *.env.example files document the vars.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Signing material & keys
*.pem
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest

# ---------- Dependencies ----------
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# ---------- JS / TS build output ----------
dist/
build/
web-build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------- Expo / Metro ----------
.expo/
.expo-shared/
.metro-health-check*

# ---------- iOS: CocoaPods + Xcode ----------
# Keep ios/ SOURCE (Info.plist, *.xcodeproj, Podfile, Podfile.lock, .xcode.env).
# Ignore everything generated, including the custom build_*/ archive dirs (~GBs).
Pods/
build_*/
DerivedData/
*.xcarchive
*.ipa
*.dSYM
*.dSYM.zip
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
# Xcode's machine-local Node path (the tracked .xcode.env stays)
.xcode.env.local

# ---------- Logs ----------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ---------- Caches ----------
.cache/
.eslintcache
.prettiercache

# ---------- Deploy (web / infra) ----------
.vercel
.netlify
.wrangler/

# ---------- OS cruft ----------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------- Editor / IDE ----------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---------- Local tooling & AI-agent files (not public) ----------
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scratch/
claude-memory/
/RESTORE.md

# ---------- Local-only working docs (kept on disk, out of the public repo) ----------
/CHECKLIST.md
/APPSTORE_RELEASE.md
/LEGAL_AUDIT.md
/docs/gdpr-records.md
